## Summary

I shipped a production-polished native Apple SwiftUI **`Combobox`** shared surface (P4 · 0148) at parity with `web/src/components/forms/Combobox.tsx`, following the in-tree `UnitInput`/`ActiveFilterChips` architecture.

**14 files** committed (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/Combobox.*`):
- **Pure Foundation core** — `Adapter` (types/slug/config), `Projection` (web `defaultFilter`, cap, ArrowDown/Up wraparound, `{{count}}` interpolation, listbox resolution)
- **State layer** — `Model` (@Observable @MainActor + telemetry/announcer seams), `Intents` (debounced **cancel-on-keystroke async loader** = web `AbortController` → `Task` cancellation), `Seams` (P1/S8 source + live/in-memory)
- **SwiftUI** — `swift` (3 inits), `Views` (field + spinner/clear/chevron + `.onKeyPress` keyboard contract + freshness chip), `Listbox` (option/loading/error/empty rows + "+N more" footer), `Previews` (9 states)
- **i18n** — `Strings` + `.strings` (8 verbatim web keys + P4-leaf keys)
- **Tests** — Adapter/Model/Views (**44 tests**)

**Every state renders**: loading, empty, populated (active-descendant + selected highlight), overflow, clear/chevron, free-text, plus the P4-leaf error-retry / stale / offline freshness axis.

